    <!--
        The Archive summons. Not a second consent — the album mode is the consent, and CLAUDE.md
        forbids mirroring Android's trash dialog with an app-level one. This exists because
        createTrashRequest can only launch from an Activity, so the user has to be brought back; and
        because it can say the one thing Android's dialog cannot, which is that the cloud copy is
        verified.
    -->
